        return PipelineTriggerEvent(
            projectId = projectId ?: throw IllegalArgumentException("projectId is required"),
            pipelineId = pipelineId ?: throw IllegalArgumentException("pipelineId is required"),
            // ... 其他字段
        )
    }
}
```

**使用方式**：
